    "Each entry is either { \"cli\": \"<subcommand> <verb...>\" } (the CLI command that does the same thing) or",
    "{ \"skip\": \"<reason>\" } for routes that are not a user action the CLI should offer (daemon/agent",
    "internals, sign-in, billing, webhooks, cron). A new route without an entry fails the test: add the",
    "CLI command, or a skip with a real reason.",
